OL,3,GNEWSADrivers face 1,250 stops a year at
OL,4,Adamaged bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoad traffic will be stopped at a key
OL,7,Friver bridge - damaged when a boat hit
OL,8,Fit - every time a ship needs to pass
OL,9,Funderneath until "urgent" repairs are
OL,10,Fcomplete.
OL,12,FA North Yorkshire Council report said
OL,13,Fthe interim safety measures at Selby
OL,14,FToll Bridge could mean 1,250 stoppages
OL,15,Feach year, causing
OL,16,F"congestion,b@/delaysb@/and reduced
OL,17,Fnetwork reliability for local traffic".
OL,19,FThe council has bid to the government
OL,20,Ffor #89.3m to replace the bridge and
OL,21,Frepair Selby bypass bridge, nearly
OL,22,Ftriple the original estimate.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
