OL,3,GNEWSADrivers face 1,250 stops a year at
OL,4,Adamaged bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) said
OL,7,Fdecisions on applications to its
OL,8,FStructure Fund, which was introduced to
OL,9,Fhelp councils repair and replace ageing
OL,10,Fbridges, would be made in the autumn.
